Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:03.31,TL,,0,0,0,,九站 五冠 前五站全是辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:14.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jannik Sinner ends Italy's 50-year wait for a champion in Rome.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N罗马等了{\fs78}50{\fs68}年 辛纳终结了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:15.54,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2026{\fs68}赛季
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:18.20,TL,,0,0,0,,九站{\fs78}ATP1000{\fs68}赛全部打完
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.87,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}座奖杯 只分给了{\fs78}5{\fs68}个人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.36,0:00:22.56,TL,,0,0,0,,前五站的奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:24.92,TL,,0,0,0,,全是同一个人举起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:29.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}月 印第安维尔斯 对梅德韦德夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.61,TL,,0,0,0,,第一盘抢七 辛纳拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.52,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘又进抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.06,TL,,0,0,0,,梅德韦德夫一度{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:40.96,TL,,0,0,0,,他从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.89,TL,,0,0,0,,一口气连拿七分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:54.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And California dreams come true for Jannik Sinner,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N加州梦成真 属于扬尼克 辛纳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:01:00.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}as he rises up to snatch glory as champion of Indian Wells.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他登顶 成为印第安维尔斯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The one that eluded him.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他一直没拿到的那座奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:05.56,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And singles champion, Jannik Sinner!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N单打冠军 扬尼克 辛纳！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:13.16,TL,,0,0,0,,两周后 迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:14.82,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛中途两次雨停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:17.09,TL,,0,0,0,,每次都等了一个半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:27.46,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a Sinner Sunshine Double.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是属于辛纳的阳光双冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:35.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The Italian adds the Miami title to his Indian Wells trophy earlier this month.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N继印第安维尔斯之后 又拿下迈阿密
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:38.74,TL,,0,0,0,,一盘不丢的阳光双冠 男子第一人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.22,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ladies and gentlemen, may I present to you your Miami Open{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N女士们先生们 迈阿密公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.22,0:01:47.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}men's singles champion, Jannik Sinner!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N男单冠军 扬尼克 辛纳！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:51.11,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月 蒙特卡洛 对面是阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:54.19,TL,,0,0,0,,赢下这场 他就重回世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:57.30,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘 阿尔卡拉斯先拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:59.43,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳随后连赢{\fs78}5{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:13.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Sinner that reigns supreme in Monte Carlo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N蒙特卡洛 辛纳称王！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.36,0:02:24.00,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}月 马德里 对兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.00,0:02:26.89,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 不到一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:47.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Jannik Sinner rewrites the history books.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N辛纳改写了历史
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.72,0:02:57.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He becomes the first ever man to win five consecutive Masters 1000 events.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N史上第一位大师赛五连冠的男子球员
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:03.98,TL,,0,0,0,,然后是罗马 决赛对鲁德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:26.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He claims his first title here at the Foro Italico,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他在罗马的第一个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:34.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and in the process becomes just the second man ever to claim all nine Masters titles.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是史上第二位集齐九站大师赛的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:44.00,TL,,0,0,0,,可罗马之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.60,TL,,0,0,0,,辛纳一站大师赛都没能再打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.27,TL,,0,0,0,,后面四站 换了{\fs78}4{\fs68}个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:51.44,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:53.98,TL,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿卫冕加拿大大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:57.21,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘抢七 谢尔顿{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:58.92,TL,,0,0,0,,拿到{\fs78}3{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.40,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Here we go.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:21.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton delivers a masterful performance in Montreal that will yield the most glittering of prizes.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿打出大师级表现 捧走大奖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:27.90,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Remarkable stuff from start to finish, as Ben Shelton wins his seventh career title,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从头到尾都出色 谢尔顿生涯第七冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.90,0:04:30.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}his first ever without dropping a set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是第一次一盘不丢夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.86,0:04:34.21,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}天后 辛辛那提 菲斯对蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.01,TL,,0,0,0,,次盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}输掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:39.48,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘他{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}0{\fs68}拿回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.54,0:04:54.68,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Arthur Fils, quite scintillating in Cincinnati.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯 在辛辛那提光芒四射
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:02.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is the biggest title of his young career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他年轻生涯里最大的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:11.10,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月 上海 {\fs78}20{\fs68}岁的霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.83,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:19.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a chase from Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N福基纳这次追球太惊人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:25.16,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to get his first break of the match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了本场第一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:31.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The nuclear athleticism that is so often associated with this guy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这种爆发力 一直是他的招牌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:33.34,TL,,0,0,0,,抢七扳回第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:36.06,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 他发球胜赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.38,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Game, set, match.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:47.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alejandro Davidovich Fokina{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N亚历杭德罗 达维多维奇 福基纳
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:54.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}claims a maiden Masters 1000 title in Shanghai.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在上海夺得生涯首座大师赛冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:59.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A week where he has proved his resilience.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一周 他证明了自己的坚韧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:03.39,TL,,0,0,0,,最后一站 巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:06.66,TL,,0,0,0,,阿卡在{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛 救下两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz back from the brink.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯从悬崖边回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:25.86,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a heartbreaker for Taylor Fritz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对弗里茨来说 太让人心碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:27.69,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.83,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘他救下{\fs78}6{\fs68}个破发点 抢七拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:53.44,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz wins the Rolex Paris Masters for the very first time in his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯第一次赢下巴黎大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:07:03.24,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He sure is on fire, a third title in his last four tournaments for Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N状态火热 最近四站拿下三冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:06.28,TL,,0,0,0,,前五站一个人 后四站{\fs78}4{\fs68}个人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.31,TL,,0,0,0,,九站决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.31,0:07:09.66,TL,,0,0,0,,你心里最好看的是哪一场？
